INSERT INTO AgentRun (uuid, dtDateTime, dtFinishDateTime, sStatus, sMode, sModel, iInputChars, sInputHash, sInputText, iDurationMs, iPromptTokens, iCompletionTokens, iTotalTokens, iRepairCount, sError, sResultJson, sJobUUID, bError) VALUES ('e2c76395-8cbf-4805-b1a5-39a01e136aca', strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%fZ', 'now', '-4980980 seconds'), strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%fZ', 'now', '-4980966 seconds'), 'succeeded', 'deepseek', 'deepseek-flash', 935, '4e1e30134307602a', 'Software Engineer (TypeScript)
Contoso · Auckland Central · Full time
Listed on SEEK · Apply now

Contoso makes rostering and payroll software for 1,800 New Zealand hospitality and retail businesses.

The role
Join our Scheduling squad and build the features managers use every Monday morning: shift planning,
leave approvals and labour-cost forecasts. You will work across our Next.js front end and Node.js services.

You will
- Build product features end to end in TypeScript, React and Node.js
- Design and evolve REST APIs backed by PostgreSQL
- Write automated tests and keep our CI pipeline green
- Pair with product and design on discovery

You have
- 2+ years building web applications professionally
- Strong TypeScript and React
- Experience with Node.js and relational databases
- A habit of writing tests

Nice to have: AWS, GitHub Actions, Playwright.

